      "x": 106407,
      "y": -9493,
      "name": "PDF to JPG / Many outputs — Scrollable grid · 12 images",
      "context": "Many-output design variant: 12 generated JPGs. Fixed-height output grid scrolls vertically; eight items are shown at this scroll position and four remain below. Header and ZIP download do not scroll. Click or Enter on a thumbnail opens the full-screen viewer at that image; return restores scroll and focus. Cards keep a consistent size; columns adapt to panel width. All 12 files are included in Download ZIP, regardless of which are currently visible. Each card has persistent Preview and Download buttons. Preview opens that JPG; Download saves that JPG only, keeping the grid and scroll position unchanged. Download ZIP always includes all 12 images.",
