                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "After entering “white” or “#GGGGGG”: keep the typed value. Show “Enter a six-digit hex color, e.g. #FFFFFF (white)” beneath Background color; set aria-invalid and associate the error. Choose background color opens a keyboard-accessible picker. A valid pick fills #RRGGBB and re-enables conversion.",
